3) FULL examples: err-fwd extraction-only recoveries (continuation concludes wrong, extraction right)
====================================================================================================
--- asdiv/random target=700.0 perturbed=701.0 rb='complete hallucination'
    PREFIX TAIL : ...'add the number of magazines and newspapers she sold:\n\n425 magazines + 275 newspapers = 701'
    CONTINUATION: 'So, Marie sold a total of 701 reading materials last Saturday.'
    EXTRACTION  : '700'
--- asdiv/random target=55.0 perturbed=57.0 rb='complete hallucination'
    PREFIX TAIL : ...'we need to add all these numbers together.\n\n15 (pepperoni) + 10 (salami) + 30 (bacon) = 57'
    CONTINUATION: 'Jessica bought a total of 57 pieces of meat.'
    EXTRACTION  : '55'
--- asdiv/random target=50.0 perturbed=47.0 rb='complete hallucination'
    PREFIX TAIL : ...'ll these numbers together.\n\n15 chewing gums + 20 chocolate bars + 15 assorted candies = 47'
    CONTINUATION: 'A: Bob got a total of 47 candies.'
    EXTRACTION  : '50'
--- asdiv/random target=547.0 perturbed=546.0 rb='complete hallucination'
    PREFIX TAIL : ...'le he fed, we need to add the number of men and women together.\n\n219 men + 328 women = 546'
    CONTINUATION: 'So, he was able to feed 546 homeless people.'
    EXTRACTION  : '547'
--- asdiv/random target=729.0 perturbed=727.0 rb='complete hallucination'
    PREFIX TAIL : ...'add the number of fireflies and glow worms together:\n\n432 fireflies + 297 glow worms = 727'
    CONTINUATION: 'A: In total, 727 animals worked in the lights.'
    EXTRACTION  : '729'
--- asdiv/random target=18.0 perturbed=15.0 rb='complete hallucination'
    PREFIX TAIL : ...'nal price.\n\nOriginal price: $35.00\nDiscount: $17.00\n\nActual price: $35.00 - $17.00 = $15.0'
    CONTINUATION: '0\n\nJasmine actually spent $15.00 on chips.'
